<title>USA: Telular proposes Herrmann as CFO.</title>
<headline>Telular proposes Herrmann as CFO.</headline>
<dateline>VERNON HILLS, Ill. 1997-07-01</dateline>
<text>
<p>Telular Corp, a telecommunications technology company, said Tuesday it expects its board of directors to approve the nomination of Jeffrey Herrmann as chief financial officer.</p>
<p>The management change is expected to be effective July 22, 1997.</p>
<p>Herrmann would replace Thomas Mason, who will become chief financial officer of a privately-held company, Telular said.</p>
<p>Herrmann has been Telular's corporate controller.</p>
<p>((Chicago newsdesk, 312-408-8787))</p>
